0,000 + 17 × 1,282. Then 17 × 1,282 becomes 17,000 + 17 × 282, where 17 × 282 = 17 × (280 + 2) = 4,760 + 34 = 4,794.\n\nSo 17 × 1,282 = 21,794, making 17 × 641,282 = 10,901,794, and therefore 817 × 641,282 = 523,127,394. This decomposition gives me 36,088,078,747,394, but I'm getting a different answer than before. Let me try a different factorization to double-check: 9,910,817 = 10,000,000 - 89,183, so the product becomes 10,000,000 × 3,641,282 - 89,183 × 3,641,282 = 36,412,820,000,000 - 89,183 × 3,641,282. Now I need to calculate 89,183 × 3,641,282 by splitting it as 89,183 × 3,600,000 + 89,183 × 41,282.\n\nFor 89,183 × 36 = 3,210,588, so 89,183 × 3,600,000 = 321,058,800,000. Then 89,183 × 41,282 breaks down to 89,183 × 40,000 + 89,183 × 1,282. Since 89,183 × 1,282 = 89,183,000 + 89,183 × 282, and 89,183 × 282 = 26,754,900 - 1,605,294 = 25,149,606, I get 89,183 × 1,282 = 114,332,606 and 89,183 × 41,282 = 3,681,652,606. Adding these: 89,183 × 3,641,282 = 321,058,800,000 + 3,681,652,606 = 3,748,659,407,394. Now I need to verify this sum and subtract from the base calculation.\n\nAdding 321,058,800,000 + 3,681,652,606 gives 324,740,452,606, so 89,183 × 3,641,282 = 324,740,452,606. This means 9,910,817 × 3,641,282 = 36,412,820,000,000 - 324,740,452,606 = 36,088,079,547,394. I realize I made an error in my FOIL approach—Term 2 should be 6,355,628,547,394 rather than 6,355,104,620,000. To verify, I should check 9,910,000 × 641,282 using the same breakdown method.\n\nFrom the calculation: 817 × 3,000,000 = 2,451,000,000 and 817 × 641,282 = 523,127,394. Working backward from the verified product, 9,910,000 × 641,282 = 36,088,079,547,394 - 29,730,000,000,000 - 2,451,000,000 - 523,127,394 = 3,904,628,547,394. But I had calculated 6,355,104,620,000 earlier, which is vastly different. The issue is my FOIL expansion was incorrect. Using the subtraction method that worked: 9,910,817 × 3,641,282 = (10,000,000 - 89,183) × 3,641,282 = 36,412,820,000,000 - 324,740,452,606 = 36,088,079,547,394.\n\nNow I need to divide 36,088,079,547,394 by 17,455. Estimating roughly 2 billion, I'll use systematic subtraction: 17,455 × 2,000,000,000 = 34,910,000,000,000 leaves 1,178,079,547,394. Then 17,455 × 67,000,000 = 1,169,485,000,000 leaves 8,594,547,394. Continuing: 17,455 × 492,000 = 8,587,860,000 leaves 6,687,394, and 17,455 × 383 = 6,685,265 leaves 2,129. The quotient is 2,067,492,383 with remainder 2,129.\n\nVerifying: 17,455 × 2,067,492,383 = 34,910,000,000,000 + 1,169,485,000,000 + 8,587,860,000 + 6,685,265 = 36,088,079,545,265, and 36,088,079,547,394 - 36,088,079,545,265 = 2,129, confirming the answer is 2,067,492,383.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":21707,"cache_read_input_tokens":20965,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":21707},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d9f195d0-1482-2f53-8201-0c62f5f59b22","uuid":"f8732a7a-0967-48c8-982d-e5f1372af3ff"}
